{"id": "coaching/01078458", "th": "dd4048c8", "dur": 23.457, "scenes": [{"kind": "intro", "label": null, "heading": "Ask happy clients for referrals out loud", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 7.409, "sents": [{"t0": 0.35, "t1": 2.607, "d": "Ask happy clients for referrals out loud", "w": [0.35, 0.611, 0.996, 1.291, 1.552, 2.076, 2.337]}, {"t0": 2.847, "t1": 7.409, "d": "Happy clients rarely refer on their own. Most are glad to help once you ask.", "w": [2.847, 3.226, 3.516, 4.008, 4.387, 4.636, 4.91, 5.246, 5.511, 5.769, 6.035, 6.284, 6.55, 6.816, 7.073]}]}, {"kind": "point", "label": null, "heading": "They are busy, not unwilling", "t0": 8.029, "t1": 13.85, "sents": [{"t0": 8.029, "t1": 11.366, "d": "It does not occur to a client that you have room for more people.", "w": [8.029, 8.239, 8.462, 8.679, 8.997, 9.207, 9.41, 9.648, 9.871, 10.088, 10.311, 10.535, 10.751, 10.975], "p": [[10, "🤷", "They assume full", "no"]]}, {"t0": 11.606, "t1": 13.85, "d": "Nobody asks, so nobody refers.", "w": [11.606, 12.135, 12.554, 12.822, 13.35]}], "ic": "🤷"}, {"kind": "point", "label": null, "heading": "Ask, and name the person", "t0": 14.47, "t1": 22.907, "sents": [{"t0": 14.47, "t1": 18.458, "d": "Right after a win, say you would love to work with more people in their position.", "w": [14.47, 14.694, 15.004, 15.201, 15.514, 15.725, 15.936, 16.16, 16.377, 16.581, 16.799, 17.016, 17.233, 17.55, 17.754, 17.978]}, {"t0": 18.698, "t1": 22.907, "d": "Then describe your ideal client in one sentence so they know who to think of.", "w": [18.698, 18.953, 19.339, 19.593, 19.956, 20.226, 20.465, 20.712, 21.098, 21.337, 21.591, 21.846, 22.093, 22.331, 22.594], "p": [[7, "🎯", "Describe one person", "do"]]}], "ic": "🎯"}], "take": "Ask directly after a win, and name exactly who you want."}